@rootURL = http://localhost:5168
@contentType = application/json

### 1. Login to get token
POST {{rootURL}}/api/Auth/login
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

{
  "email": "test@test.nl",
  "password": "Test@123"
}

### 2. Register a new user (if needed)
POST {{rootURL}}/api/Auth/register
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

{
  "email": "test@test.nl",
  "password": "Test@123",
  "fullName": "Test User",
  "role": "HotelOwner"
}

### 3. Test protected endpoint with token (replace YOUR_TOKEN)
GET {{rootURL}}/api/Hotel
Authorization: Bearer eyJhbGciOiJIUzI1NiIsInR5cCI6IkpXVCJ9..Rw4GaLW4bs9kl_Lh1OOyHQXOQNucZbjw43X1Hqw6V7A
Content-Type: {{contentType}}


###
GET {{rootURL}}/weatherforecast/
Accept: application/json